#AI:1
TYPE="archive"
SCOPE="project history"

PURPOSE:
Historical THREADS, DECISIONS, DELTA experiments, and HANDOFF_LOG entries beyond
the latest 2. Read on demand (Tier 2) — not loaded every session.

When readme_AI.ai grows, move the oldest HANDOFF entries here and close
THREADS here when done.

---

CLOSED_THREADS:
; Move completed or cancelled THREADS here from readme_AI.ai.
; Format: THR-NNN|closed|tier=X|"description"|closed=YYYY-MM-DD|outcome="..."
; (none yet)

---

DECISIONS:
; Append-only record of decisions made during project work.
; Current decisions that remain in effect also live in ai_context/decision_log.md.
; Format:
; @date|DEC-NNN|
; decision="..."|
; rationale="..."|
; alternatives="..."|
; impact="..."|
; evidence="..."

@2026-04-29T00:00-0400|DEC-001|
decision="Initialized project continuity cartridge from template"|
rationale="Every project needs a stable AI-readable state file from day one"|
alternatives="Ad hoc chat-only continuity"|
impact="Future work accumulates explicit decisions, experiments, and project state in one place"|
evidence="Bootstrap files created"

---

DELTA:
; Historical experiments. Recent experiments live in readme_AI.ai until archived.
; Format:
; @time|TYPE|ID|
; topic="..."|
; status=worked|failed|partial|unknown|
; change="..."|expect="..."|observe="..."|
; repro="..."|revert="..."|location="..."|tags="a,b,c"|evidence="..."

@2026-04-29T00:00-0400|EXP|EXP-000|
topic="bootstrap"|
status=unknown|
change="initialized readme_AI.ai from template"|
expect="AI boots with correct project context"|
observe="pending"|
repro="AI echoes unlock phrase + threads + assumptions"|
revert="delete file"|
location="readme_AI.ai"|
tags="continuity,boot"|
evidence="none"

---

HANDOFF_ARCHIVE:
; HANDOFF entries older than the latest 2. Move from readme_AI.ai as new entries accumulate.
; (none yet — see readme_AI.ai for current entries)

---

ARCHIVE:
; Optional compressed historical blocks when this file grows.
; Z=<algo>:<base64>
